1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,900
Every space mission starts as a design.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,900
Pick a rocket, a rover, power, an antenna
and instruments, within mass and budget.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,900
Launch with real NASA data and photos.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,900
Then operate it: drive, drill, build,
and send data to Earth.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,900
Real NASA events force real decisions.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,900
Design it. Fly it.
Compare it with NASA's.
